  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday, this video is for the newer people, on how we find great stocks early. Like Palantir….BEFORE it ran 580%. Or Roblox….BEFORE it ran 180%. </p><p><strong>Watch the video</strong>, it is why I make them. Not a big writer personally. </p><p>Here is the filtering criteria for stocks, that narrowed the list down to 339 stocks to review. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png\" width=\"1134\" height=\"225\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:225,&quot;width&quot;:1134,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:47924,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/211188718?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!weoc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbdb29431-333d-4ab2-8d6b-3e060257fa8e_1134x225.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>This is the work that I do on a regular basis for everyone, and why things like the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> doubling, sometimes tripling, the performance of the S&amp;P 500. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3vgw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3vgw!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3vgw!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3vgw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3vgw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3vgw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png\" width=\"883\" height=\"809\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/755996ea-ddbf-4070-b288-5bef776dc5ea_883x809.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:809,&quot;width&quot;:883,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:96383,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quo