.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I am not buying anything today. But if you would like the list of stocks that made the cut today, they are screen shot down below. Feel free to reach out to me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/8aac3321-fed7-4dd4-a536-a9fb92d3e2bb\">Main Chat</a> if you have any questions, during market hours. </p><h4>Oh, and be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 to combat the AI slop on here! </h4><p>Have a great weekend, and I will see you Monday!</p><p><strong>The 20 stocks that made this list ⬇️</strong></p>",
